@startuml 019-live-feed-sequence
title 019 live-feed：時序圖

actor "學生（第2組）" as S
participant "server views（不改）" as V
participant "useLiveView（live.ts）" as L
participant "Teacher" as T
participant "useLiveFeed" as F
participant "antd notification" as N
actor "老師" as Teacher

L --> T : 第一個老師 view（開頁／重整）
T -> F : useLiveFeed(view)
F -> F : prev 為 null，只記為基準（不出通知）
S -> V : 送出第 3 題
V --> L : 新老師 view（phase=answering、board 多一筆）
L --> T : view
T -> F : useLiveFeed(view)
F -> F : feedEvents(prev, next)：第3題新增第2組、rank 1、經典
F -> N : open「第2組 搶下第 3 題！」（不含答案）
N --> Teacher : 右上角快訊，3 秒後消失
F -> F : prev = view
@enduml
